<h4>2.4 The Trinitarian Missions: The Circle of Love</h4>
<p>Draw a diagram of the "circle of love": Father → Son → Holy Spirit → us → back to the Father. Explain how the entire structure of Christian prayer — "to the Father, through the Son, in the Holy Spirit" — follows this pattern. Why is the Holy Spirit described as the "Gift" between the Father and the Son?</p>
