<h4>2.5 The Indwelling of the Trinity in the Soul</h4>
<p>What does it mean that the Blessed Trinity "makes a home" (Jn 14:23) in the soul of every person in a state of grace? Why is mortal sin described as expelling the Trinity from the temple of the soul? How does confession restore this indwelling presence?</p>
