<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">3. In what specific moment of your life have you experienced something like Trinitarian love — love that gives itself without counting the cost, that does not hold back, that generates life and joy in others?</p>
<p class="question-block__p">It could be in your family, in a friendship, in an act of service, in receiving the Eucharist. Try to recall not just the general feeling but the concrete details: who was there, what was said or done, and why that moment felt different from ordinary affection.</p>
