<p class="question-block__q">4. The Sign of the Cross immerses us in the Trinity every time we make it. How can you live with more awareness of this mystery in your daily life?</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Name one concrete, specific action you will take this week: make the Sign of the Cross slowly and deliberately each morning, pray the Glory Be with real attention, address each divine Person by name in your daily prayer, or consciously make room at your table for someone who is alone.</p>
