<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">5. St. Paul blesses the Corinthians with "The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, the love of God, and the fellowship of the Holy Spirit be with you all" (2 Cor 13:13). What does it mean for you to live under this threefold blessing?</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Grace (the gift of the Son), love (the heart of the Father), and fellowship (the communion of the Spirit) — these are the three dimensions of Trinitarian life offered to you every day. If you woke up tomorrow and truly believed these three things were yours, how would your day be different?</p>
