<section class="content" id="activities">

<h3>Section 4 &mdash; Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. Contemplate Rublev's Icon with Attention</h4>
<p>Find a high-quality image of Andrei Rublev's icon of the Trinity online (search "Rublev Trinity icon high resolution"). Spend at least 10 minutes looking at it silently, without distractions. Then write: (1) What do you notice about the posture of each angel? (2) What do the three background symbols — the house, the tree, the mountain — suggest to you? (3) Why do you think there is an empty place at the front of the table? What does that empty space say to you personally?</p>
