<h4>B. Make Your Sign of the Cross a Prayer</h4>
<p>This week, every time you make the Sign of the Cross — in the morning, before meals, entering a church, beginning and ending your prayer — do it slowly. Consciously name each Person in your heart. Touch your forehead thinking "Father, you created me"; your chest thinking "Son, you redeemed me"; each shoulder thinking "Holy Spirit, you dwell in me." At the end of the week, write a paragraph: did doing this slowly change anything about how you experienced the gesture?</p>
