<h4>C. Write a Trinitarian Prayer</h4>
<p>Compose a short prayer addressed to each of the three divine Persons. The structure is simple but powerful: "Father, I thank you for ______________. Son, I thank you for ______________. Holy Spirit, I thank you for ______________." Fill each blank with something specific from your life — not something generic, but something real. Then pray this prayer aloud, addressing each Person by name.</p>
