<h4>D. Observe Trinitarian Love in Daily Life</h4>
<p>During the coming week, keep a small journal or note on your phone. Write down three specific moments when you witnessed love that gave itself without holding back — a person who served you, a generous gesture that moved you, a moment of genuine communion. For each one, briefly note: who was involved, what happened, and why it felt like a glimpse of something bigger than ordinary kindness. At the end of the week, read your three entries and look for a pattern. What do these moments have in common?</p>
